          "weather_entity": "Needs an hourly forecast. Without it there are no tipping points and no 24 h plan.",
          "outdoor_temperature_sensor": "Your own sensor is preferred over the weather service. Make sure it is not in direct sun.",
          "building_type": "Only used as a starting value for the thermal model - it is replaced by measurements later."
